=== reading B: Precise does NOT widen the compute type past storage ===
  distinct extents: 251
  extents mapping to more than one carrier: 0
  -> extent -> carrier IS a function under this reading.
     so the objection survives the arithmetic, and only part (b) answers it.

=== reading A: Precise DOES widen the compute type past storage ===
  distinct extents: 251
  extents mapping to more than one carrier: 64
  witness: extent (W=1, stride=8) is shared by [Hot, Warm, Precise], which need carriers [8, 16]
  -> extent -> carrier is NOT a function. the pair is irreducible both ways.

part (b) is in p5b_const_to_type.rs, which does not compile on purpose.
see p5b_const_to_type.err for the diagnostic.
